WEBVTT

00:00:08.110 --> 00:00:14.300
Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:22.680
aoku nemuru mizu no hoshi ni sotto

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:22.680
Kissing softly the star of water that sleeps in blue,

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:31.410
kuchizuke shite inochi no hi wo tomosu hito yo

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:31.410
A person who lights the fire of life,

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:36.300
toki to iu kin'iro no sazanami wa

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:36.300
The time, the golden ripple,

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:45.070
oozora no kuchibiru ni umareta toiki ne

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:45.070
is a sigh from the lips of the sky,

00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:49.300
kokoro ni uzumoreta

00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:49.300
The stars of kindness...

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:52.270
yasashisa no hoshitachi ga

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:52.270
...buried in heart flame up...

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:56.440
honoo age yobiau

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:56.440
...and call to each other,

00:00:56.440 --> 00:01:03.430
namima sasurau nanpasen no you ni

00:00:56.440 --> 00:01:03.430
Like wrecked ships wandering on the waves...

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:08.870
mou nakanaide ima

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:08.870
Don't cry, any more,

00:01:08.870 --> 00:01:16.240
anata wo sagashite iru hito ga iru kara

00:01:08.870 --> 00:01:16.240
because now there is a person looking for you,

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:20.970
omae ni aitai yo to

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:20.970
Dying to see you...

00:01:33.970 --> 00:01:38.340
The fleet led by Scirocco
assaulted Von Braun City.

00:01:39.270 --> 00:01:42.640
Although the Argama and the Radish
fought a defensive battle against the fleet...

00:01:42.710 --> 00:01:45.640
...they could not stop Scirocco's progress.

00:01:45.710 --> 00:01:49.010
Von Braun City fell into
the hands of the Titans.

00:01:49.220 --> 00:01:54.080
Counterattack

00:02:06.900 --> 00:02:08.890
Von Braun City has fallen
into the enemy's hands.

00:02:08.970 --> 00:02:10.800
How could Lieutenant Quattro
and Commodore Blex...

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:12.800
...go to Earth at a time like this?

00:02:12.870 --> 00:02:15.170
Wars consist of a lot more
than just battles.

00:02:16.310 --> 00:02:18.240
Commander, what's the status
of our supplies?

00:02:18.310 --> 00:02:19.000
Not good.

00:02:19.080 --> 00:02:22.010
We don't have the manpower with Granada
constructing an underground city and all!

00:02:22.080 --> 00:02:23.510
It's the same with us.

00:02:23.580 --> 00:02:28.180
By the way, I wanted your opinion
on the organization of the mobile suits.

00:02:32.220 --> 00:02:33.780
- Commander!
- As I was saying...!

00:03:20.670 --> 00:03:21.400
Commodore.

00:03:21.470 --> 00:03:23.100
I know.

00:03:37.260 --> 00:03:37.980
Wait!

00:03:39.260 --> 00:03:41.160
At least tell me where you're going!

00:03:41.230 --> 00:03:43.090
Something's not right with Haro.

00:03:43.160 --> 00:03:44.690
- Fix him.
- R-Right!

00:03:44.760 --> 00:03:46.290
So where are you going?!

00:03:46.360 --> 00:03:47.630
To Von Braun City.

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:48.930
But that place...!

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:51.260
I'm going on orders.

00:03:51.670 --> 00:03:52.500
Kamille!

00:03:52.570 --> 00:03:54.540
Haro! Feeling sick! Feeling sick!

00:03:56.340 --> 00:03:57.810
Why does just Kamille get to go?!

00:03:59.440 --> 00:04:00.430
Later, sir.

00:04:00.510 --> 00:04:03.110
All we need to know is
the number of Titan mobile suits.

00:04:03.180 --> 00:04:04.210
I understand!

00:04:04.280 --> 00:04:06.840
I should also find out how far
the citizens of Von Braun City...

00:04:06.920 --> 00:04:07.850
...will accept the Titans' authority, right?!

00:04:07.920 --> 00:04:09.010
I'll help!

00:04:09.090 --> 00:04:10.610
Yeah, if you can.

00:04:10.690 --> 00:04:11.710
Don't be discouraged.

00:04:11.790 --> 00:04:13.690
I'll join you later.

00:04:13.760 --> 00:04:14.450
Roger!

00:04:14.530 --> 00:04:18.290
Don't forget to send us a signal
of your location when we approach.

00:04:18.700 --> 00:04:19.530
Right.

00:04:19.600 --> 00:04:21.930
I don't want to be killed
by my comrades, after all.

00:04:22.930 --> 00:04:24.490
Have you loaded the air-car?

00:04:24.570 --> 00:04:26.130
Yes, we're done.

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:28.140
- Close the door!
- Yes, sir!

00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:33.340
I thought I saw Katz around.

00:04:33.410 --> 00:04:34.470
Yes! Huh?

00:04:53.400 --> 00:04:57.800
Those laid-back people on Earth don't
give a damn about what's going on in space!

00:04:58.300 --> 00:04:59.240
Right.

00:04:59.300 --> 00:05:01.470
I couldn't believe it when I heard...

00:05:01.540 --> 00:05:05.740
...they might hand over command
of the Federation Forces to the Titans.

00:05:06.880 --> 00:05:11.280
Jamitov had the nerve to say politicians
on Earth should be living on Earth.

00:05:11.350 --> 00:05:14.180
Look at this African continent.
It's become more than half desert!

00:05:14.250 --> 00:05:16.220
Yet he ignores this reality
and insists it is fine!

00:05:17.690 --> 00:05:21.680
Isn't there any way to send all politicians
to outer space?

00:05:22.690 --> 00:05:24.630
They say they're afraid
of getting space-sick.

00:05:34.240 --> 00:05:36.100
We're almost at Von Braun City.

00:05:36.170 --> 00:05:38.300
- You've got to look like a tourist.
- I know.

00:05:38.540 --> 00:05:40.510
Do you remember your cover?

00:05:40.580 --> 00:05:41.310
Yeah.

00:05:41.650 --> 00:05:43.670
I'm a freshman at Mizusa College.

00:05:43.750 --> 00:05:45.610
Shree Klime, age 18.

00:05:50.960 --> 00:05:51.920
I know it won't happen...

00:05:51.990 --> 00:05:54.960
...but I'm going to suggest having
the politicians move to space anyway.

00:05:55.030 --> 00:05:56.930
- With an urgent motion?
- Yes.

00:05:58.760 --> 00:06:00.200
That might not be a bad idea.

00:06:22.990 --> 00:06:24.920
That's the one from the other day!

00:06:33.160 --> 00:06:34.760
Damn Scirocco is finally going...

00:06:34.830 --> 00:06:38.100
...even though he initially said he'd
be returning to the Jupitris right away!

00:06:38.170 --> 00:06:39.430
Lieutenant Commander Jamaican!

00:06:41.240 --> 00:06:44.210
I thought you guys
were on the Dogosse Gier.

00:06:44.280 --> 00:06:47.140
They left us behind
because of my injury.

00:06:47.450 --> 00:06:49.940
Not only is Scirocco unable
to grasp what's going on...

00:06:50.020 --> 00:06:51.950
...but he can't even manage
his own subordinates.

00:06:52.020 --> 00:06:53.810
Lieutenant Commander,
we have a favor to ask.

00:06:54.350 --> 00:06:55.150
What is it?

00:06:55.350 --> 00:07:00.120
We'd like to be included in
the Alexandria's mobile suit team.

00:07:00.560 --> 00:07:02.860
Don't assume you can always
have things your way!

00:07:02.930 --> 00:07:04.520
We've got more than enough pilots.

00:07:05.030 --> 00:07:05.830
Lieutenant Commander!

00:07:05.960 --> 00:07:09.800
Why not relax and go shopping
or something? Think of it as a holiday.

00:07:09.870 --> 00:07:12.700
That's a great idea. Let's go, Mouar!

00:07:13.670 --> 00:07:14.500
Jerid!

00:07:16.940 --> 00:07:18.880
And to think they consider
themselves Titans.

00:07:19.780 --> 00:07:23.150
Didn't you see the sign that said
"Restricted to Authorized Personnel Only"?

00:07:23.210 --> 00:07:24.770
Huh? What sign?

00:07:25.580 --> 00:07:26.450
Kamille?!

00:07:27.520 --> 00:07:28.490
Jerid.

00:07:28.550 --> 00:07:31.150
- I can show you my ID!
- You're bluffing!

00:07:31.220 --> 00:07:32.350
Wait!

00:07:35.030 --> 00:07:37.650
Please forgive him. He's my cousin.

00:07:38.200 --> 00:07:39.290
Your cousin, Lieutenant?

00:07:39.360 --> 00:07:41.060
He's crazy about battleships.

00:07:41.130 --> 00:07:43.330
And he always forgets
where to draw the line.

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:44.770
Can you let him go, for me?

00:07:45.440 --> 00:07:46.400
I understand.

00:07:46.470 --> 00:07:49.100
If he's your relative...!

00:07:50.240 --> 00:07:51.210
Kamille!

00:07:53.010 --> 00:07:54.100
Wait! Kamille!

00:07:54.350 --> 00:07:55.310
Kamille?

00:08:12.500 --> 00:08:13.860
Give that back!

00:08:18.770 --> 00:08:22.400
Has the A.E.U.G. sunk so low as to
require a guy like you to spy for them?

00:08:22.940 --> 00:08:25.100
Turn me over to security if you wish.

00:08:25.180 --> 00:08:27.510
I'll do that after I've had a
chance to kill you.

00:08:28.080 --> 00:08:30.780
Stop it Jerid. He's just a child.

00:08:30.850 --> 00:08:34.220
This is no child!
He's killed both Lila and Kacricon!

00:08:36.220 --> 00:08:38.420
Then is he the Newtype
you were talking about?!

00:08:39.120 --> 00:08:40.650
I'm no Newtype!

00:08:40.730 --> 00:08:41.660
Shut up!

00:08:41.730 --> 00:08:44.890
Then are you suggesting Lila and Kacricon
were killed by a common child?

00:08:44.960 --> 00:08:46.450
You're always coming back to that point.

00:08:46.530 --> 00:08:48.620
I told you to shut up!

00:08:53.370 --> 00:08:56.400
<i>So this child is the pilot</i>
<i>of the Zeta Gundam.</i>

00:08:56.910 --> 00:08:59.780
<i>Where, in this small body,</i>
<i>does he store all that strength?</i>

00:09:02.550 --> 00:09:05.110
- What do you intend to do, Jerid?
- I'll detain him.

00:09:05.180 --> 00:09:09.450
Right. Detaining this boy would
be a loss to the A.E.U.G., wouldn't it?

00:09:10.520 --> 00:09:13.650
It'll increase the pressure
not having a Newtype with them.

00:09:14.390 --> 00:09:17.620
The A.E.U.G. will have no problem
fighting without me.

00:09:17.700 --> 00:09:18.920
I wouldn't be so sure.

00:09:19.000 --> 00:09:20.930
Get up!

00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:28.030
If you move, I'll shoot!

00:09:28.110 --> 00:09:29.730
You too, lady!

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:31.940
- Katz!
- Throw away your gun!

00:09:32.010 --> 00:09:33.910
Now!

00:09:37.020 --> 00:09:40.010
Guide us to your mobile suits.

00:09:40.080 --> 00:09:41.310
What do you intend to do?

00:09:41.390 --> 00:09:43.450
Isn't it obvious?!
We'll take them and escape!

00:09:43.520 --> 00:09:44.990
How heroic.

00:09:45.690 --> 00:09:47.090
I'm not joking!

00:09:47.360 --> 00:09:48.920
All right.

00:09:52.460 --> 00:09:53.430
Stop!

00:09:58.200 --> 00:09:59.670
He got the gun that Amuro gave me.

00:09:59.740 --> 00:10:01.230
Right now, that's not important!

00:10:01.810 --> 00:10:03.240
- Stop!
- Don't shoot.

00:10:03.310 --> 00:10:05.110
You could hit a civilian.

00:10:14.250 --> 00:10:16.190
Same time tomorrow.

00:10:33.340 --> 00:10:34.530
Stay back, it's dangerous here!

00:10:34.610 --> 00:10:36.570
Inform the police at once.

00:10:59.900 --> 00:11:00.890
Commodore!

00:11:01.630 --> 00:11:03.600
Oh, Lieutenant Quattro.

00:11:03.670 --> 00:11:04.730
Commodore!

00:11:04.800 --> 00:11:06.790
The Titans got me.

00:11:06.870 --> 00:11:08.960
Please stay alert, sir.

00:11:11.010 --> 00:11:15.710
I'd like you... to become a person...
who will change the world.

00:11:15.780 --> 00:11:17.080
Commodore.

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:20.580
Become leader of the A.E.U.G....

00:11:21.520 --> 00:11:23.380
...Char Aznable.

00:11:26.460 --> 00:11:28.430
Commodore Blex!

00:11:41.440 --> 00:11:43.030
We've got a big one in sight.

00:11:43.780 --> 00:11:45.830
We'll stage a surprise attack
and sink them at one go.

00:11:45.910 --> 00:11:49.110
<i>Shouldn't we be informing the Alexandria,</i>
<i>Lieutenant Yazan?</i>

00:11:49.710 --> 00:11:50.980
We're going!

00:11:51.050 --> 00:11:51.980
<i>Roger.</i>

00:12:14.610 --> 00:12:16.340
Send out mobile suits!

00:12:16.410 --> 00:12:17.670
From the ones that are ready to go!

00:12:17.740 --> 00:12:19.070
Reinforcements will be coming!

00:12:19.580 --> 00:12:20.640
Apolly, ready for take off!

00:12:22.380 --> 00:12:23.510
Emma, taking off!

00:12:27.150 --> 00:12:29.810
How come they sent their
scouts all the way out here?

00:12:38.360 --> 00:12:39.330
Alright!

00:12:42.530 --> 00:12:44.020
Thank you, Haro!

00:12:44.670 --> 00:12:46.690
Good luck, Fa! Good luck, Fa!

00:12:49.540 --> 00:12:50.630
Fa, taking off!

00:12:57.250 --> 00:12:58.440
That damn transforming mobile suit!

00:13:04.660 --> 00:13:07.150
Is this the mobile suit
Kamille was talking about?!

00:13:12.400 --> 00:13:14.560
Th-The controls won't work!

00:13:20.570 --> 00:13:21.730
What's wrong?

00:13:21.810 --> 00:13:23.360
The Argama's close by, isn't it?

00:13:23.940 --> 00:13:26.380
But there's still time before
we start our operation.

00:13:26.480 --> 00:13:27.440
Really?

00:13:29.650 --> 00:13:30.880
But don't you feel it?

00:13:30.950 --> 00:13:32.750
It's the same feeling
as when a battle breaks out.

00:13:33.520 --> 00:13:35.450
But we're not hearing any air-raid alarm!

00:13:35.520 --> 00:13:36.990
- It's happening!
- Kamille!

00:13:41.430 --> 00:13:42.150
Found him!

00:13:42.630 --> 00:13:43.690
Enemy attack?!

00:13:43.760 --> 00:13:45.420
What's Yazan doing?!

00:13:45.500 --> 00:13:48.230
He seems to be engaging the enemy
regardless of their distance.

00:13:48.300 --> 00:13:50.100
Prepare the fleet for launch!

00:13:50.170 --> 00:13:51.470
Send out reinforcement mobile suits!

00:13:51.540 --> 00:13:52.370
Yes, sir!

00:13:52.440 --> 00:13:53.840
Also, call Jerid and Mouar back!

00:13:54.540 --> 00:13:56.510
We have no idea
where they went shopping.

00:13:57.480 --> 00:13:59.270
An air-raid alarm in the city
will get their attention!

00:13:59.340 --> 00:14:00.170
Hurry!

00:14:16.730 --> 00:14:19.720
You may transform like me, but this one's
developed on Earth and used out here!

00:14:19.800 --> 00:14:21.420
Its capabilities are far superior!

00:14:29.540 --> 00:14:30.270
There!

00:14:47.090 --> 00:14:48.990
- The masks!
- They've released the masks!

00:15:00.710 --> 00:15:04.640
The Methuss and... what's that other one?
The model with that lady pilot?

00:15:04.710 --> 00:15:05.680
Kamille!

00:15:06.210 --> 00:15:08.180
Hurry, there'll be no masks left!

00:15:14.520 --> 00:15:15.380
What?!

00:15:15.450 --> 00:15:17.150
What's a child doing with a gun?!

00:15:17.360 --> 00:15:19.260
What a coincidence.

00:15:19.460 --> 00:15:21.190
Shall we exchange shots?

00:15:22.090 --> 00:15:22.990
Don't do it, Katz.

00:15:23.860 --> 00:15:25.660
Jerid.

00:15:32.970 --> 00:15:35.500
<i>There's a hole in the outer wall!</i>
<i>Go in from there!</i>

00:15:35.570 --> 00:15:37.400
<i>Do whatever it takes to get Kamille!</i>

00:15:37.480 --> 00:15:38.440
Roger!

00:15:49.350 --> 00:15:50.910
I-Is this the end?

00:15:50.990 --> 00:15:51.850
No!

00:15:56.030 --> 00:15:57.590
Are you all right, Fa?

00:15:57.660 --> 00:16:00.220
Thank you, Lieutenant Apolly.

00:16:10.910 --> 00:16:12.970
Kamille. You're Kamille Bidan,
aren't you?

00:16:13.040 --> 00:16:14.510
- Yes.
- I knew it!

00:16:14.580 --> 00:16:18.540
I know you well, because my dad's
supporting the A.E.U.G.'s cause.

00:16:21.490 --> 00:16:23.820
You're quite the celebrity, Kamille.

00:16:23.890 --> 00:16:24.950
Naturally!

00:16:25.020 --> 00:16:26.150
Unlike anyone from the Titans!

00:16:26.660 --> 00:16:28.180
Shut your mouth, kid!

00:16:28.260 --> 00:16:31.490
The Titans are a group of demons
that pollute Earth.

00:16:31.560 --> 00:16:32.360
He's right.

00:16:32.660 --> 00:16:34.930
Only the Titans would
battle inside the city like this!

00:16:35.000 --> 00:16:36.860
We want all you demons out of here!

00:16:36.930 --> 00:16:37.990
Bastards.

00:16:38.070 --> 00:16:40.470
What's happening here
is all the Titans' fault!

00:16:40.540 --> 00:16:41.700
The A.E.U.G. started it!

00:16:42.340 --> 00:16:44.900
- Stop it, Katz!
- But it's the truth!

00:16:45.140 --> 00:16:49.100
Regardless whose fault it is, the citizens
of Von Braun City are suffering the most!

00:16:49.810 --> 00:16:52.040
You sound like a goody-goody, Kamille?

00:17:02.630 --> 00:17:04.030
The Zeta Gundam's coming.

00:17:04.560 --> 00:17:06.090
Kamille?

00:17:06.160 --> 00:17:07.930
Katz, let's go!

00:17:08.200 --> 00:17:09.330
Wait!

00:17:09.400 --> 00:17:11.270
You're going to stay here
and remain quiet...!

00:17:11.340 --> 00:17:12.930
Kamille, I'll take care of things here!

00:17:13.200 --> 00:17:14.070
Katz...!

00:17:14.140 --> 00:17:16.110
I can be useful at times, too. Hurry!

00:17:16.270 --> 00:17:17.240
Thanks, Katz!

00:17:17.310 --> 00:17:18.640
- Wait!
- I'm going to shoot!

00:17:18.710 --> 00:17:20.680
I know that!

00:17:23.410 --> 00:17:25.470
I have no intention of exchanging fire here.

00:17:25.550 --> 00:17:27.450
I don't want to die in vain.

00:17:27.520 --> 00:17:28.640
Kid.

00:17:29.150 --> 00:17:31.210
Thank you very much.

00:17:31.290 --> 00:17:33.450
I can't return this gun.

00:17:34.660 --> 00:17:36.350
I'm impressed, Jerid.

00:17:36.990 --> 00:17:40.620
Until now, you've always taken action
based on your emotions alone.

00:17:41.000 --> 00:17:43.930
But then, you'd never be able
to reach for the top.

00:17:44.070 --> 00:17:46.000
You'd never be anything more
than a soldier.

00:17:46.070 --> 00:17:48.870
I can take the temporary embarrassment.

00:17:48.940 --> 00:17:51.600
Things have calmed down.
We should get to the Alexandria.

00:17:51.680 --> 00:17:52.300
Right.

00:17:52.680 --> 00:17:53.610
Move!

00:17:53.680 --> 00:17:56.580
You're going to fight, aren't you?
I won't allow that!

00:18:00.750 --> 00:18:02.240
Damn you!

00:18:03.290 --> 00:18:05.350
You'd better not get any ideas!

00:18:05.420 --> 00:18:08.260
Civilians don't have a chance
in a fight against the Titans!

00:18:13.130 --> 00:18:14.690
Another new model!
You're going nowhere!

00:18:22.910 --> 00:18:23.770
Miss Reccoa!

00:18:24.210 --> 00:18:25.110
Kamille.

00:18:25.180 --> 00:18:27.340
I worried because I couldn't detect
your signal...!

00:18:27.410 --> 00:18:28.380
Behind you!

00:18:39.090 --> 00:18:40.850
Two against one?!

00:18:42.990 --> 00:18:44.930
Ensign Reccoa, let Kamille on!

00:18:45.000 --> 00:18:46.050
Right!

00:18:48.600 --> 00:18:50.030
Kamille, where's Katz?!

00:18:50.900 --> 00:18:51.960
He's okay.

00:18:54.010 --> 00:18:55.560
- Katz!
- Leave Katz to me!

00:18:55.640 --> 00:18:57.470
- You get on the Zeta, Kamille!
- Thank you.

00:19:00.410 --> 00:19:02.000
Miss Reccoa.

00:19:02.080 --> 00:19:03.310
Kamille, let's do it!

00:19:14.330 --> 00:19:15.260
Out of my way!

00:19:19.930 --> 00:19:20.660
What?!

00:19:21.530 --> 00:19:22.760
I won't allow it!

00:19:23.230 --> 00:19:24.030
Kamille!

00:19:26.770 --> 00:19:29.330
This guy's suddenly moving better!

00:19:31.110 --> 00:19:32.670
He's got some skills after all.

00:19:32.740 --> 00:19:35.580
Do you think this is
some sort of game or something?!

00:19:35.710 --> 00:19:36.770
A child?

00:19:36.850 --> 00:19:37.940
I'm no child!

00:19:43.450 --> 00:19:45.790
The A.E.U.G.'s taken over
the power station?!

00:19:46.320 --> 00:19:48.590
And our mobile suits are struggling.

00:19:48.860 --> 00:19:52.190
We've got no option.
Tell all vessels to get ready to retreat.

00:19:52.260 --> 00:19:53.730
Convene all staff!

00:19:53.800 --> 00:19:54.960
However, if we went now...!

00:19:55.570 --> 00:19:57.830
There's no use just remaining here!

00:19:57.900 --> 00:19:59.730
And if we allow
the enemy to get above us...

00:19:59.800 --> 00:20:02.770
...the Alexandria will end up
as scrap metal!

00:20:03.170 --> 00:20:03.870
Very well, sir.

00:20:06.010 --> 00:20:08.270
Lieutenant Commander,
I've come to ask you a favor.

00:20:08.350 --> 00:20:09.840
What have you been doing?

00:20:09.910 --> 00:20:11.510
Lend me a mobile suit.

00:20:11.580 --> 00:20:12.450
I beg you, sir.

00:20:13.720 --> 00:20:16.120
Too bad for you, we're retreating.

00:20:16.820 --> 00:20:18.910
There's no longer the need to sortie.

00:20:18.990 --> 00:20:19.790
You're kidding...!

00:20:20.260 --> 00:20:21.620
I won't throw you out.

00:20:21.690 --> 00:20:24.560
You can remain here aboard
the Alexandria.

00:20:24.830 --> 00:20:27.230
I suggest you don't forget that obedience.

00:20:28.300 --> 00:20:30.630
- Jamaican.
- Jerid.

00:20:30.700 --> 00:20:31.830
I know.

00:20:31.900 --> 00:20:35.130
Someday, I'll make that man
kneel before me.

00:20:45.520 --> 00:20:46.450
Retreat?!

00:20:46.520 --> 00:20:47.780
Why not finish it?!

00:20:47.850 --> 00:20:49.820
What's Jamaican thinking?!

00:20:51.360 --> 00:20:52.690
Let's meet again, kid!

00:20:52.890 --> 00:20:54.220
Damn you!

00:20:57.660 --> 00:20:58.990
I'll get you.

00:20:59.060 --> 00:21:00.000
<i>Kamille!</i>

00:21:00.130 --> 00:21:01.100
Miss Emma?

00:21:01.530 --> 00:21:04.630
The battle is over.
There's no need to chase after it!

00:21:04.700 --> 00:21:05.460
But...!

00:21:05.540 --> 00:21:07.500
In a battle, it's important to know
when to pull back.

00:21:10.470 --> 00:21:11.840
I understand!

00:21:20.450 --> 00:21:22.780
<i>By unanimous decision...</i>

00:21:22.850 --> 00:21:24.680
<i>...we will hereby adopt this bill.</i>

00:21:35.830 --> 00:21:38.130
So he's the mastermind
behind the Titans' organization?

00:21:38.200 --> 00:21:39.230
With this...

00:21:39.570 --> 00:21:42.660
<i>...the Earth Federation Forces are
controlled by the Titans...</i>

00:21:42.740 --> 00:21:45.680
<i>...and justice will be theirs.</i>

00:21:45.740 --> 00:21:47.510
<i>However, will this hold?</i>

00:21:47.580 --> 00:21:50.170
<i>Decisions by those who sold
their souls for their immediate needs...</i>

00:21:50.250 --> 00:21:53.050
<i>...are likely to crumble easily.</i>

00:22:01.160 --> 00:22:02.350
How's that injury coming along?

00:22:03.690 --> 00:22:05.250
I was expecting to be "corrected".

00:22:05.760 --> 00:22:07.530
Don't put your life to waste.

00:22:07.600 --> 00:22:08.390
Yes, sir.

00:22:11.270 --> 00:22:14.730
All because I was so absorbed
in the situation...

00:22:14.810 --> 00:22:17.040
...and escaped into Von Braun City...

00:22:17.110 --> 00:22:19.540
...the city has now been destroyed...!

00:22:24.520 --> 00:22:26.420
<i>But it's all right.</i>

00:22:26.480 --> 00:22:28.450
<i>Because we all survived.</i>

00:22:28.850 --> 00:22:31.880
<i>But what about Commodore Blex</i>
<i>and Lieutenant Quattro?</i>

00:22:31.960 --> 00:22:33.920
<i>I wonder if they're okay.</i>

00:22:47.270 --> 00:22:49.600
Oh, I can't help believing you

00:22:50.480 --> 00:22:56.020
kanarazu aeru to ano hi kara shinjiteita

00:22:50.480 --> 00:22:56.020
I've believed we're sure to meet again ever since that day

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:01.400
kitto yobiau kokoro ga areba

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:01.400
If we have heart, we'll be called together again

00:23:01.450 --> 00:23:11.790
mugen no Energy yobisamasu

00:23:01.450 --> 00:23:11.790
Awaken the infinite energy

00:23:11.830 --> 00:23:17.420
aa kizutsukeau mae ni

00:23:11.830 --> 00:23:17.420
Before you get hurt

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:23.510
dekiru koto sagashite Please

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:23.510
Find what you can do...Please

00:23:23.550 --> 00:23:28.680
nagedasanai de kurushii toki koso

00:23:23.550 --> 00:23:28.680
Don't throw it away because of this painful age

00:23:29.390 --> 00:23:32.020
itsuka mita aoi sora wo

00:23:29.390 --> 00:23:32.020
Until the day we gaze up again

00:23:32.030 --> 00:23:39.030
kitto anata to miageru hi made

00:23:32.030 --> 00:23:39.030
at the blue sky we once saw

00:23:45.530 --> 00:23:49.330
Scirocco's subordinate, Sarah, informs
the Argama of Jamaican's plan...

00:23:49.400 --> 00:23:50.730
...to drop the Colony.

00:23:51.500 --> 00:23:56.030
Bright believes her and rushes
to intercept the Colony in its descent.

00:23:57.070 --> 00:23:59.270
This is because, should Granada
become a sea of fire...

00:23:59.340 --> 00:24:01.310
...it will signal the defeat
of the A.E.U.G..

00:24:02.010 --> 00:24:07.310
Next on Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam,
"Colony Drop".

00:24:07.460 --> 00:24:12.440
Next Episode

00:24:07.460 --> 00:24:12.440
Colony Drop

00:24:07.550 --> 00:24:10.690
You will see the tears of time.
